          <string>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Step Range&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Choose All Steps, Current Step, or Custom Range. The From and To fields are used only for Custom Range. Both endpoints are included, and To may equal From to save just one step.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
